        "value": "藩制一覧表　第一（生坂）／はんせいいちらんひょう　だいいち（いくさか）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Hansei ichiran-hyō (Survey of Domain Institutions), Fascicle 1 (Ikusaka). This is the outer-margin running head and serves as provenance for the leaf; it names Ikusaka, the domain whose entry opens at the marker, even though most of the data printed on the leaf belongs to Iwakitaira."
